# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GENEPIO_0001739> (after)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GENEPIO_0001739> "T1 after t2 iff:= t2 before_or_simulataneous_with t1 and not (t1 simultaeous_with t2)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GENEPIO_0001739> "after"@en)
InverseObjectProperties(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GENEPIO_0001739> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002083>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000039> (has measurement unit label)

